Hosts lists the browser blocks (host and every subdomain), when requested
by a different site. Format: "0.0.0.0 host" / "127.0.0.1 host" / "host".
Any *.txt or *.hosts file here or in ~/.local/share/ultimate-browser/blocklists
is loaded at start.

stevenblack.hosts -- StevenBlack/hosts unified list (adware + malware),
MIT licence, https://github.com/StevenBlack/hosts. Snapshot; refresh with
  curl -L -o stevenblack.hosts https://raw.githubusercontent.com/StevenBlack/hosts/master/hosts
